  "1.3/local/closed-map/.scratch/billing-v2/map.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1) -->\n# Billing v2\n\nStatus: resolved\n\n## Destination\n\nA spec for usage-based billing, ready to hand to /to-spec.\n\n## Decisions so far\n\n- [Billing model](issues/01-billing-model.md): charge per seat plus metered usage.\n- [Gateway limits](issues/02-gateway-limits.md): the gateway caps a batch at 500 charges.\n\n## Not yet specified\n\n- How invoices are archived once a customer is closed.\n",
  "1.3/local/mixed/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/01-billing-model.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1), with a claimed and a blocked ticket added -->\n# 01: Billing model\n\nType: grilling\nStatus: resolved\n\n## Question\n\nPer seat, metered, or both?\n\n## Answer\n\nBoth.\n",
  "1.3/local/mixed/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/02-gateway-limits.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1), with a claimed and a blocked ticket added -->\n# 02: Gateway limits\n\nType: research\nStatus: resolved\n\n## Question\n\nWhat does the payment gateway cap?\n\n## Answer\n\nA batch holds 500 charges.\n",
