  "1.3/local/mixed/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/04-tax-rounding.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1), with a claimed and a blocked ticket added -->\n# 04: Tax rounding\n\nType: grilling\nBlocked by: none\n\n## Question\n\nRound per line or per invoice?\n",
  "1.3/local/mixed/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/05-proration-rules.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1), with a claimed and a blocked ticket added -->\n# 05: Proration rules\n\nType: grilling\nStatus: claimed\nAssignee: tinekondo\n\n## Question\n\nHow is a mid-cycle change prorated?\n",
