  "1.3/local/mixed/.scratch/billing-v2/map.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1), with a claimed and a blocked ticket added -->\n# Billing v2\n\n## Destination\n\nA spec for usage-based billing, ready to hand to /to-spec.\n\n## Notes\n\n- Domain: the billing glossary.\n- Plan, don't do: tickets produce decisions, not code.\n\n## Decisions so far\n\n- [Billing model](issues/01-billing-model.md): charge per seat plus metered usage.\n- [Gateway limits](issues/02-gateway-limits.md): the gateway caps a batch at 500 charges.\n\n## Not yet specified\n\n- How invoices are archived once a customer is closed.\n\n## Out of scope\n\n- Tax filing.\n",
  "1.3/local/prose-trap/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/01-billing-model.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1) -->\n# 01: Billing model\n\nType: grilling\nStatus: open\n\n## Question\n\nPer seat, metered, or both?\n\n## Comments\n\nQuoting ticket 02, which is decided:\nStatus: resolved\nBlocked by: 02\nAssignee: someone\n",
