  "1.3/local/prose-trap/.scratch/billing-v2/issues/03-invoice-layout.md": "<!-- hand-made: shaped like the craftory-mvp wayfinder tree (mattpocock-skills 1.3.1) -->\n# 03: Invoice layout\n\nType: prototype\nStatus: open\n\n## Question\n\nWhat does an invoice look like?\n\n## Notes\n\nDepends on the answer to 02 and quotes ticket 01:\nStatus: resolved\nBlocked by: 01\nAssignee: someone\n",
